DV Companion 0.2.1 — independent Windows companion for iniVation DV.
Companion code, original icon artwork, and local modifications: Apache-2.0.

Native modifications are based on iniVation dv-runtime 1.7.1 and dv-processing
2.0.2, both distributed under Apache-2.0. Original upstream copyright and
license notices remain in the downloaded source trees; copies of the top-level
licenses are in native/licenses/. Source URLs and exact archive SHA256 values
are recorded in native/source-archives.json. native/protocol.fbs follows the
upstream runtime configuration protocol.

Modified upstream files: runtime src/log.cpp, src/log_safety.hpp,
src/devices_discovery.cpp, src/config_server/config_server_actions.cpp;
processing include/dv-processing/io/camera/davis.hpp and usb_device.hpp.
Changes include UTF-8 validation, logging recursion protection and lock ordering,
device metadata refresh, missing-device messages and discovery/open serialization.
See native/local-changes.patch and native/build_native.py for the changes.

No original Java GUI, installed DV package, SDK DLL or third-party runtime binary
is included. Native components link to the user's existing DV installation.
Downloaded header/library packages retain their own licenses under
native/native-deps/mingw64/share/licenses/. This is not an official iniVation release.
